{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/binghatti-phantom-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":695,"crm_id":"906","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Binghatti Phantom","slug":"binghatti-phantom-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","commerce"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Binghatti","price":1000000,"display_price":"1M","lattitude":25.049516,"longitude":55.2054601,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Binghatti Phantom - an ultra luxurious project by Binghatti, located in the developed vibrant area of JVC. The complex is a 44-storey tower offering royal residences with private pools and a variety of one and three bedroom apartments.</p><p>The complex has an amazing unique architecture. The tower has a circular shape, the facade designs combine traditional Middle Eastern and modern styles, and the panoramic windows and intertwining balconies with glass enclosures make the building a true work of art in the world of architecture. Only the highest quality materials are used in the interiors, giving each residence a luxurious yet cosy atmosphere.</p><p>The four floors of the large podium contain a variety of world-class amenities that can provide residents with a comfortable space for entertainment and relaxation. The first four floors contain commercial spaces and resident parking, while on the roof of the podium, residents will find a large infinity pool with lounge areas, a tennis court, a children's playground with swimming pool, and numerous landscaped areas for recreation and leisure.</p><p>Another feature of the complex is its favourable location. Circle Mall and the prestigious Gems British Academy are just 5 minutes away by car, while Al Khail Avenue Mall is 7 minutes away. Mall of Emirates, Dubai Marina and Burj Al Arab are all within 10 minutes' drive. Dubai City Centre, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 12 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","hash":"phantom_feat_7838900a64","name":" Binghatti Phantom"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/phantom_banner_16833087e5.jpg","hash":"phantom_banner_16833087e5","name":" Binghatti Phantom"},"media_images":null,"images":[{"id":13869,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/906/images/i/phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","hash":"phantom_feat_7838900a64","mime":"image/jpeg","name":" Binghatti Phantom","size":37.98,"width":585,"height":353,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_phantom_feat_7838900a64","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_phantom-feat.jpg","path":null,"size":12.57,"width":245,"height":148}},"provider":"aws-s3","createdAt":"2024-07-31T09:28:13.354Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-31T09:28:29.201Z","folderPath":"/","previewUrl":null,"__ggfxIndex":0,"alternativeText":" Binghatti Phantom","provider_metadata":null},{"id":13869,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/906/images/i/phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","hash":"phantom_feat_7838900a64","mime":"image/jpeg","name":" Binghatti Phantom","size":37.98,"width":585,"height":353,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_phantom_feat_7838900a64.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_phantom_feat_7838900a64","mime":"image/jpeg","nam